---
layout: "layouts/landing.njk"
locale: "en"
permalink: "/index.html"
canonical: "/"
alternate_url: "/ar/"
x_default_url: "/"
page_kind: "home"
page_css: "home-en.css"
title: "SMILE Pro Laser Eye Surgery, New Cairo | Dr. Mohamed El Naggar"
description: "SMILE Pro flapless laser vision correction at Dr. Mohamed El Naggar Eye Clinic, Eterna Medical City, New Cairo. ZEISS VisuMax 800. 15-minute procedure, no corneal flap. Book a vision assessment."
image: "/images/Naggar6.png"
schema_type: "clinic"
show_sticky: true
sitemap: true
---
{% from "partials/forms.njk" import consultation %}
<div class="urgency-bar">
  <span>Limited:</span> Only <strong id="slot-count">8</strong> assessment slots remaining this week at our Mivida clinic
</div>



<!-- HERO SECTION -->
<header class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="hero-pill">
        <span class="hero-pill-dot"></span>
        ZEISS VisuMax 800 Technology
      </div>
      <h1>Clear Vision in <em>8 Seconds</em> Per Eye</h1>
      <p class="hero-kicker">Dr. Mohamed El Naggar — Consultant Corneal & Refractive Surgeon</p>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Experience SMILE Pro flapless laser vision correction at Eterna Medical City, New Cairo.
        Advanced German laser precision with minimal disruption and rapid recovery.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-proof">
        <div class="hero-proof-item">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
          No Corneal Flap
        </div>
        <div class="hero-proof-item">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
          Micro-Incision &lt; 2mm
        </div>
        <div class="hero-proof-item">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
          Resume Driving Same Day
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- HERO FORM CARD -->
    <div class="form-card" id="book">
      <h2 class="form-card-title">Book Vision Assessment</h2>
      <p class="form-card-sub">Reserve your evaluation at Eterna Medical City, New Cairo</p>

      {{ consultation('en', 'consultation', 'main-form', 'main', false, 'smile-pro') }}

      <a href="tel:{{ site.contact.phone_e164 }}" class="form-call-btn">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 013.07 9.81a19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.72A2 2 0 012 .18h3a2 2 0 012 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L6.09 7.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg>
        Call {{ site.contact.phone_display_en }}
      </a>

      <div class="form-wa">
        <span>Prefer instant messaging?</span>
        <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}" target="_blank" class="wa-link" rel="noopener">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12.031 2c-5.514 0-9.998 4.486-9.998 10 0 2.012.602 3.88 1.637 5.441l-1.67 6.109 6.284-1.646c1.487.818 3.197 1.296 5.011 1.296 5.514 0 9.998-4.486 9.998-10 0-5.514-4.484-10-9.998-10zm0 18.002c-1.633 0-3.155-.443-4.469-1.215l-.321-.189-3.321.87.886-3.238-.211-.336c-.927-1.479-1.421-3.189-1.421-4.992 0-4.687 3.813-8.502 8.502-8.502 4.687 0 8.5 3.815 8.5 8.502 0 4.687-3.813 8.502-8.502 8.502z"/></svg>
          Chat on WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- TRUST BAR -->
  <div class="trust-bar">
    <div class="container trust-inner">
      <div class="trust-item">
        <div class="trust-num">8 Sec</div>
        <div class="trust-lbl">Laser Time Per Eye</div>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-item">
        <div class="trust-num">&lt; 2mm</div>
        <div class="trust-lbl">Micro-Incision</div>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-item">
        <div class="trust-num">100%</div>
        <div class="trust-lbl">Flapless Procedure</div>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-item">
        <div class="trust-num">12 Mos</div>
        <div class="trust-lbl">Follow-Up Included</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- BENEFITS SECTION -->
<section class="section" id="benefits">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="lbl">Why SMILE Pro</span>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <h2>Engineered for Precision and Comfort</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);max-width:700px;margin-bottom:32px;">
      SMILE Pro utilizes the ZEISS VisuMax 800 to reshape corneal tissue internally without creating a standard flap. This design prioritizes structural integrity and rapid recovery.
    </p>

    <div class="benefits-grid fade-up">
      <div class="b-card">
        <div class="b-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>No Flap Creation</h3>
        <p>By avoiding a traditional corneal flap, SMILE Pro maintains maximum corneal stability and reduces post-operative sensitivity.</p>
        <span class="b-tag">Preserved Structure</span>
      </div>

      <div class="b-card">
        <div class="b-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>8-Second Laser Delivery</h3>
        <p>The ZEISS VisuMax 800 delivers precise laser pulses in under 10 seconds per eye, ensuring a quick and smooth process.</p>
        <span class="b-tag">Fast Experience</span>
      </div>

      <div class="b-card">
        <div class="b-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Rapid Daily Return</h3>
        <p>Most patients resume reading, digital screen work, and normal non-contact routines within 24 hours of treatment.</p>
        <span class="b-tag">Minimal Downtime</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- JOURNEY TIMELINE -->
<section class="section" id="journey" style="background:var(--cream2);">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="lbl">Step-by-Step Experience</span>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <h2>Your Treatment Journey</h2>

    <div class="timeline fade-up">
      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-dot-wrap">
          <div class="tl-dot">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="tl-dot-num">01</span>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <div class="tl-time">Step 1 — Comprehensive Scan</div>
          <h3 class="tl-title">Corneal & Vision Mapping</h3>
          <p class="tl-desc">Detailed diagnostic imaging checks corneal thickness, curvature, and prescription accuracy to confirm complete candidate suitability.</p>
          <div class="tl-highlight">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
            Personalized Treatment Plan
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-dot-wrap">
          <div class="tl-dot">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 8v4l3 3"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="tl-dot-num">02</span>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <div class="tl-time">Step 2 — Procedure Day</div>
          <h3 class="tl-title">15-Minute Micro-Incision Laser</h3>
          <p class="tl-desc">Numbing eye drops are applied for complete comfort. The ZEISS VisuMax 800 shapes the tissue layer in roughly 8 seconds per eye, followed by removal through a tiny micro-incision.</p>
          <div class="tl-highlight">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
            No Stitches or Flaps
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-dot-wrap">
          <div class="tl-dot">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="tl-dot-num">03</span>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <div class="tl-time">Step 3 — Recovery & Aftercare</div>
          <h3 class="tl-title">Next-Day Clarity & 12 Months Support</h3>
          <p class="tl-desc">Vision stabilizes rapidly over the first 24 hours. Full post-procedure follow-up visits and prescription drops are included for an entire year.</p>
          <div class="tl-highlight">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
            1 Year Follow-Up Care
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- COMPARISON SECTION -->
<section class="section" id="comparison">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="lbl">Technology Comparison</span>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <h2>How SMILE Pro Compares</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;">
      Selecting a laser eye procedure depends on individual eye anatomy and personal routine. Below is a feature comparison across primary vision correction methods.
    </p>

    <div class="fade-up" style="overflow-x:auto;">
      <table class="comp-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Feature / Parameter</th>
            <th>PRK / Surface</th>
            <th>Femto LASIK</th>
            <th class="col-s">SMILE Pro</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Corneal Flap Required</td>
            <td><span class="ci">✓</span> No Flap</td>
            <td><span class="cx">✗</span> Flap Created (~20mm)</td>
            <td class="col-s"><span class="ci">✓</span> No Flap (&lt;2mm Incision)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Laser Treatment Time</td>
            <td>30–60 Seconds</td>
            <td>15–30 Seconds</td>
            <td class="col-s">~8 Seconds Per Eye</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Post-Op Dry Eye Tendency</td>
            <td>Moderate</td>
            <td>Moderate to High</td>
            <td class="col-s">Minimally Affected Nerves</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Functional Visual Recovery</td>
            <td>5 to 7 Days</td>
            <td>24 Hours</td>
            <td class="col-s">24 Hours / Same Day</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Active Sport / Swimming Return</td>
            <td>1 to 2 Weeks</td>
            <td>2 to 4 Weeks</td>
            <td class="col-s">1 Week</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CALCULATOR SECTION -->
<section class="section" id="calculator" style="background:var(--cream2);">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="text-align:center;">
      <span class="lbl">Investment & Savings</span>
      <div class="rule" style="margin:0 auto 22px;"></div>
      <h2>Vision Care Cost Comparison</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 24px;">
        Estimate long-term expenditure on contacts and glasses relative to a permanent vision correction treatment.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="calc-wrap fade-up">
      <div class="calc-grid">
        <div class="calc-input-group">
          <label for="calc-age">Current Age</label>
          <input type="number" id="calc-age" value="28" min="18" max="60" oninput="calculateSavings()" />
        </div>
        <div class="calc-input-group">
          <label for="calc-spend">Annual Contact/Glass Spend (EGP)</label>
          <input type="number" id="calc-spend" value="8000" step="500" oninput="calculateSavings()" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="calc-result">
        <div>
          <div class="calc-col-lbl">Lifetime Spend (to Age 60)</div>
          <div class="calc-col-num" id="res-lifetime">256,000</div>
          <div class="calc-col-sub">EGP projected expenditure</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="calc-col-lbl">Estimated Lifetime Savings</div>
          <div class="calc-col-num savings" id="res-savings">208,000</div>
          <div class="calc-col-sub">EGP saved with SMILE Pro</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="calc-note">
        *Based on single procedure cost of EGP 55,000 compared to recurring annual lens and optical maintenance up to age 60.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- DOCTOR SECTION -->
<section class="section" id="about-doctor">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="doctor-grid fade-up">
      <div class="doc-img">
        <img src="/images/Naggar6.png" alt="Dr. Mohamed El Naggar" width="896" height="1200" loading="lazy" />
        <div class="doc-badge">
          <div class="doc-badge-num">15+</div>
          <div class="doc-badge-lbl">Years Experience</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <span class="lbl">Lead Surgeon</span>
        <div class="rule"></div>
        <h2 class="doc-name">Dr. Mohamed El Naggar</h2>
        <div class="doc-title">Consultant Corneal & Refractive Surgeon</div>
        <p class="doc-bio">
          Dr. Mohamed El Naggar specializes in advanced corneal surgery and refractive error corrections.
          Dedicated to utilizing modern diagnostic tools and proven surgical protocols to maintain high safety standards and accurate visual results.
        </p>

        <div class="creds">
          <div class="cred">
            <div class="cred-dot"></div>
            <div>Fellow of the Royal College of Surgeons (FRCS) — Ophthalmology</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cred">
            <div class="cred-dot"></div>
            <div>Fellow of the Royal College of Surgeons of Edinburgh</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cred">
            <div class="cred-dot"></div>
            <div>Member of the European Society of Cataract and Refractive Surgeons (ESCRS)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cred">
            <div class="cred-dot"></div>
            <div>Member of the American Academy of Ophthalmology (AAO)</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TECHNOLOGY SECTION -->
<section class="section tech-section" id="technology">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="lbl">Laser Platform</span>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <h2>ZEISS VisuMax 800 Engineering</h2>

    <div class="tech-grid fade-up">

      <div class="tech-features">
        <div class="tech-feat">
          <div class="tech-feat-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="tech-feat-title">High Frequency Delivery</h3>
            <div class="tech-feat-desc">Rapid laser pulse emission reduces total tissue exposure time to approximately 8 seconds per eye.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tech-feat">
          <div class="tech-feat-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="2" x2="12" y2="22"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="tech-feat-title">Ocular Alignment Guidance</h3>
            <div class="tech-feat-desc">Centration and cyclotorsion correction systems compensate for minor eye position shifts prior to laser execution.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tech-feat">
          <div class="tech-feat-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="tech-feat-title">Gentle Contact Interface</h3>
            <div class="tech-feat-desc">Ergonomically designed curved contact glass minimizes intraocular pressure elevation during treatment.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
            </div>

      <div style="border-radius:var(--r);overflow:hidden;max-height:420px;">
        <video loop muted playsinline preload="none" data-play-when-visible aria-hidden="true" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:var(--r);display:block;">
          <source src="/images/Video1.mp4" type="video/mp4"/>
        </video>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TESTIMONIALS -->
<section class="section" id="reviews">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="lbl">Patient Experiences</span>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <h2>Real Patient Outcomes</h2>

    <div class="testi-grid fade-up">
      <div class="testi-card">
        <div class="testi-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <div class="testi-quote">"The laser phase felt so quick. I was back at my desk and reviewing documents the very next afternoon."</div>
        <div class="testi-author">
          <div class="testi-avatar">A</div>
          <div>
            <div class="testi-name">Ahmed M.</div>
            <div class="testi-detail">Software Engineer • SMILE Pro</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testi-card">
        <div class="testi-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <div class="testi-quote">"Dr. El Naggar thoroughly explained my corneal scan results. The entire clinic process in New Cairo was smooth."</div>
        <div class="testi-author">
          <div class="testi-avatar">S</div>
          <div>
            <div class="testi-name">Sara K.</div>
            <div class="testi-detail">Architect • SMILE Pro</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testi-card">
        <div class="testi-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <div class="testi-quote">"Not having to deal with contact lens dryness during daily workouts has made a noticeable difference."</div>
        <div class="testi-author">
          <div class="testi-avatar">O</div>
          <div>
            <div class="testi-name">Omar T.</div>
            <div class="testi-detail">Fitness Coach • SMILE Pro</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ SECTION -->
<section class="section" id="faq" style="background:var(--cream2);">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="lbl">Questions & Answers</span>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>Does SMILE Pro hurt during or after treatment?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          Numbing eye drops are administered before starting, eliminating sharp sensation. You may feel mild pressure on the eye for about 8 seconds during laser application. Post-procedure sensation is typically minimal, with slight watery feeling for a few hours.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>How long does the laser procedure take?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          The ZEISS VisuMax 800 laser operates for approximately 8 seconds per eye. Total room time, including preparation and alignment, takes around 15 minutes for both eyes.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>Who is an eligible candidate for SMILE Pro?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          Candidates are generally adults aged 18 to 55 with stable prescription over the past year and suitable corneal thickness/topography. Final candidacy is determined through comprehensive diagnostic scanning.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>What is included in the SMILE Pro treatment fee?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          The EGP 55,000 package includes the procedure on both eyes, all surgical consumables, post-op medicated eye drops, and 12 months of follow-up evaluation appointments.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span>When can I resume work and driving?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          Most patients resume screen reading, general desk work, and driving within 24 hours. Non-contact sports can be resumed within a day, while swimming is cleared after 1 week.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- LOCATION SECTION -->
<section class="section" id="location">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="lbl">Clinic Location</span>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <h2>Visit Us in New Cairo</h2>

    <div class="split" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;margin-top:32px;">
      <div class="card">
        <h3 style="font-size:20px;color:var(--burg);margin-bottom:12px;">Dr. Mohamed El Naggar Eye Clinic</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:20px;">
          {% for line in site | clinicAddress('en') %}{{ line }}{% if not loop.last %}<br/>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </p>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text);font-weight:600;">
          Clinic Hours: {{ site.hours.en }}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="width:100%;min-height:260px;border-radius:var(--r);overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--border);">
        <iframe
          src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Eterna%20Medical%20City%20New%20Cairo&t=&z=15&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed"
          width="100%"
          height="100%"
          style="border:0;min-height:260px;"
          allowfullscreen=""
          loading="lazy">
        </iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- BOTTOM CTA -->
<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Take the First Step Toward <em>Clear Vision</em></h2>
    <p>Schedule your corneal mapping & vision suitability assessment at Eterna Medical City, New Cairo.</p>

    <div class="cta-form-wrap fade-up">
      <h3 class="form-card-title">Book Vision Assessment</h3>
      <p class="cta-form-sub">Eterna Medical City • Fifth Settlement, New Cairo</p>

      {{ consultation('en', 'consultation', 'bottom-form', 'cta', true) }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FOOTER -->
